{"key":"enterprise/T1201","id":"T1201","name":"Password Policy Discovery","domain":"enterprise","level":"technique","parent_id":null,"tactics":["discovery"],"platforms":["Windows","Linux","macOS","IaaS","Network Devices","Identity Provider","SaaS","Office Suite"],"environments":["cloud","cloud-hosted-endpoint","identity","network-infrastructure","onprem","saas"],"environment_basis":"project_taxonomy_from_upstream_platforms","summary":"Adversaries may attempt to access detailed information about the password policy used within an enterprise network or cloud environment. Password policies are a way to enforce complex passwords that are difficult to guess or crack through Brute Force. This information may help the adversary to create a list of common passwords and launch dictionary and/or brute force attacks which adheres to the policy (e.g. if the minimum password length should…","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1201","source_stix_id":"attack-pattern--b6075259-dba3-44e9-87c7-e954f37ec0d5","source_modified":"2025-10-24T17:49:15.781Z","source_object_version":"1.7","telemetry":{"status":"mapped","components":[{"id":"DC0071","name":"Active Directory Object Access","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0071","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--5c6de881-bc70-4070-855a-7a9631a407f7","page":"telemetry/DC0071/"},{"id":"DC0064","name":"Command Execution","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0064","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--685f917a-e95e-4ba0-ade1-c7d354dae6e0","page":"telemetry/DC0064/"},{"id":"DC0032","name":"Process Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0032","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--3d20385b-24ef-40e1-9f56-f39750379077","page":"telemetry/DC0032/"},{"id":"DC0013","name":"User Account Metadata","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0013","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--b5d0492b-cda4-421c-8e51-ed2b8d85c5d0","page":"telemetry/DC0013/"}],"strategies":[{"id":"DET0161","name":"Password Policy Discovery – cross-platform behavior-chain analytics","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0161","stix_id":"x-mitre-detection-strategy--72742281-7457-4124-a277-7f3cf5e23f4e","relationship_id":"relationship--61c33856-75d9-403c-a31c-e7ef853f0796"}],"analytics":[{"id":"AN0455","name":"Analytic 0455","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0161#AN0455","guidance":"Cause→effect chain: (1) a user or service spawns a shell/PowerShell that queries local/domain password policy via commands/cmdlets (e.g., `net accounts`, `Get-ADDefaultDomainPasswordPolicy`, `secedit /export`); (2) optional directory/LDAP reads from DCs; (3) same principal performs adjacent Discovery or credential-related actions within a short window. Correlate sysmon process creation with PowerShell ScriptBlock and Security logs.","platforms":["Windows"],"strategy_id":"DET0161"},{"id":"AN0456","name":"Analytic 0456","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0161#AN0456","guidance":"Chain: (1) interactive/non-interactive `chage -l`, `grep`/`cat` of PAM config (e.g., `/etc/pam.d/common-password`, `/etc/security/pwquality.conf`); (2) optional reads of `/etc/login.defs`; (3) same user performs account enumeration or password change attempts shortly after. Use auditd `execve` and file read events plus shell history collection.","platforms":["Linux"],"strategy_id":"DET0161"},{"id":"AN0457","name":"Analytic 0457","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0161#AN0457","guidance":"Chain: (1) execution of `pwpolicy` or MDM/DirectoryService reads of account policies; (2) optional read of `/Library/Preferences/com.apple.loginwindow` or config profiles; (3) follow-on credential probing or lateral movement by same user/session. Use unified logs and process telemetry.","platforms":["macOS"],"strategy_id":"DET0161"},{"id":"AN0458","name":"Analytic 0458","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0161#AN0458","guidance":"Chain: (1) cloud API calls that fetch tenant/organization password policy (e.g., AWS `GetAccountPasswordPolicy`, GCP/OCI equivalents or IAM settings reads); (2) within a short window, the same principal creates users, rotates creds, or changes auth settings. Use cloud audit logs.","platforms":["IaaS"],"strategy_id":"DET0161"},{"id":"AN0459","name":"Analytic 0459","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0161#AN0459","guidance":"Chain: (1) IdP policy/read operations by a principal (e.g., Microsoft Entra/Graph requests to read password or authentication policies); (2) adjacent risky changes (role assignment, app consent) by same principal. Use IdP audit logs.","platforms":["Identity Provider"],"strategy_id":"DET0161"},{"id":"AN0460","name":"Analytic 0460","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0161#AN0460","guidance":"Chain: (1) SaaS admin API or PowerShell remote session reads tenant password/authentication settings (e.g., M365 Unified Audit Log ‘Cmdlet’ with `Get-MsolPasswordPolicy`/`Get-OrganizationConfig` parameters that expose password settings); (2) same session proceeds to mailbox or tenant changes.","platforms":["SaaS"],"strategy_id":"DET0161"},{"id":"AN0461","name":"Analytic 0461","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0161#AN0461","guidance":"Chain: (1) privileged CLI sessions run read-only commands that dump AAA/password policies (e.g., `show aaa`, `show password-policy`); (2) same account changes AAA or user DB shortly after. Use network device AAA/command accounting or syslog.","platforms":["Network Devices"],"strategy_id":"DET0161"}],"log_sources":[{"component_id":"DC0032","component":"Process Creation","name":"WinEventLog:Sysmon","channel":"EventCode=1","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN0455","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0161#AN0455","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0032/"},{"component_id":"DC0064","component":"Command Execution","name":"WinEventLog:PowerShell","channel":"EventCode=4103, 4104, 4105, 4106","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN0455","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0161#AN0455","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0064/"},{"component_id":"DC0071","component":"Active Directory Object Access","name":"WinEventLog:Security","channel":"EventCode=4662","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN0455","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0161#AN0455","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0071/"},{"component_id":"DC0032","component":"Process Creation","name":"auditd:SYSCALL","channel":"execve","platforms":["Linux"],"analytic_id":"AN0456","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0161#AN0456","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0032/"},{"component_id":"DC0013","component":"User Account Metadata","name":"auditd:SYSCALL","channel":"open,openat,read","platforms":["Linux"],"analytic_id":"AN0456","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0161#AN0456","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0013/"},{"component_id":"DC0064","component":"Command Execution","name":"linux:syslog","channel":"sudo chage|grep pam_pwquality|cat /etc/login.defs","platforms":["Linux"],"analytic_id":"AN0456","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0161#AN0456","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0064/"},{"component_id":"DC0064","component":"Command Execution","name":"macos:unifiedlog","channel":"pwpolicy|PasswordPolicy","platforms":["macOS"],"analytic_id":"AN0457","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0161#AN0457","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0064/"},{"component_id":"DC0032","component":"Process 